Package: agentdagwood
Type: Package
Title: Shiny LLM-Enabled Causal Assumption Analyzer Using Dagwood
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Steven", family = "Baldasty", email = "sbaldasty@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny app that converts a free-form causal inference scenario into
    a directed acyclic graph using a LLM, runs Dagwood to extract assumptions
    and branch DAGs, and evaluates each assumption using the LLM.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    shiny,
    markdown,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    dagwood,
    ggdag,
    later
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
